{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.QuantumCharacteristicClassesExists","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.QuantumCharacteristicClassesExists","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.QuantumCharacteristicClassDisplay"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumCharClasses.exists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumCharClasses.exists","kind":"theorem","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes-exists.lean#L21-L35","doc":"**Well-definedness of quantum characteristic classes.**\n\nA `QuantumCharacteristicClass` term exists for every stage of the\nrecursive brane tower, arising as the obstruction class of a\ncentral gerbe extension (Giraud's classification). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:quantum-characteristic-classes-exists","label":"prop:quantum-characteristic-classes-exists","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/quantum-characteristic-classes-exists.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}